●	Lore: She is the keeper of the Great Library, and she has noticed the pages of future-history are beginning to turn blank. A chaotic anomaly is unravelling the fate of time itself. She marches forth with her fellow mages to rewrite the ending of the world before the ink forever dries.
●	Feat: "Sight of the Unforeseen" - Pay 2 Dice Points. Look at the top card of your deck, keep it, or send it to the discard pile.
